largest values; 和 / 与 and ampersands receive smaller ones. Compound words
retain weaker signals, with a few linguistic false friends excluded. Selected
'or' and inclusion expressions have small responses; the programming operator
'||' has a negative response. Ordinary English 'and' receives zero.

