"""'as' detector. Writes a negative value on the word "as" (and its
translations/spellings), strongest for "as" that gives a role after a verb or
object ("used as", "seen as", "treat it as", "regarded as"), weaker for fixed
phrases ("such as", "as well as", "as long as", "as far as") and for the
second "as" of "as ... as" comparisons."""

READS = ()

