"""Chinese and East Asian names, read as a negative signal.

The component goes strongly negative on the names of China and Chinese places and people
(China, Chinese, Beijing, Shanghai, Taiwan, Mandarin: about -5.5), more weakly on other
East and Southeast Asian names (Japan, Korea, Tokyo, Vietnam, Thai, Asia: about -3.3),
