"""Approximate a lexical response to pronouns and plural-person markers.

Large negative values mark they/them/their and Chinese plural pronouns.
Pronoun spellings in other languages and plural suffix fragments also respond.
Chinese pronouns fused into longer tokens are attenuated. Case, word boundaries
and document starts modify the amplitudes; otherwise return
zero. This is a spelling-level approximation, not referent resolution.
"""
READS = ()

# English plural subjects, objects, possessives and reflexives.
PLURAL_FORMS = {
    'they': -1.67, 'them': -1.51, 'their': -1.82,
    'theirs': -1.56, 'themselves': -0.84, 'yourselves': -1.19,
